<div class="takeaways">
  <p class="takeaways__title">Architectural vs asphalt shingles: the quick answer</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Architectural shingles <em>are</em> asphalt shingles. The real comparison is architectural (dimensional, laminated) vs traditional 3-tab asphalt shingles.</li>
    <li>Architectural shingles are thicker and heavier, typically rated for 110–130 mph winds vs about 60–70 mph for 3-tab.</li>
